 # Aama.io
 
-> Aama.io is fund administration and fund accounting software for mid-market PE/VC fund managers, boutique fund administrators, family offices and SPV deals across Singapore and APAC (positioned as an end-to-end fund operating platform, or "Fund OS"). It covers the fund lifecycle on one platform — fund administration, fund accounting (IFRS 9 / SFRS(I) 9), an LP portal for fund managers, back-office automation, deal flow CRM, data room, SPV management and fund reporting — with MAS and VCC sub-fund support, without enterprise complexity or pricing.
+> Aama.io is fund accounting and fund administration software for fund administrators and corporate service providers (CSPs), mid-market PE/VC and private credit fund managers, and family offices across Singapore and APAC; it also supports SPV deals (positioned as an end-to-end fund operating platform, or "Fund OS"). It covers the fund lifecycle on one platform — fund administration, fund accounting (IFRS 9 / SFRS(I) 9), an LP portal for fund managers, back-office automation, deal flow CRM, data room, SPV management and fund reporting — with MAS and VCC sub-fund support, without enterprise complexity or pricing.
 
 ## Platforms (products)
 
-- [SPV Fund Management](https://aama.io/products/spv-fund-management): Flagship end-to-end SPV and syndicate platform — vehicle formation, cap table, KYC/AML onboarding, capital calls, lead carry, distributions, general ledger, NAV and member reporting in one system.
-- [Fund Administration](https://aama.io/products/fund-administration): Capital calls, drawdowns, investor onboarding (KYC/AML), allocation tracking, LP communications and a branded investor (LP) portal with real-time NAV, statements and documents.
 - [Fund Accounting](https://aama.io/products/fund-accounting): IFRS-based fund accounting, NAV calculation, reconciliation, corporate actions and audit-ready financials. AI reads supplier invoices, bank statements and custodian statements, returns structured fields for a person to check, suggests ledger mapping and learns from earlier mappings; nothing is posted until someone accepts it, and a person posts the journal voucher.
+- [Fund Administration](https://aama.io/products/fund-administration): Capital calls, drawdowns, investor onboarding (KYC/AML), allocation tracking, LP communications and a branded investor (LP) portal with real-time NAV, statements and documents.
+- [SPV Fund Management](https://aama.io/products/spv-fund-management): End-to-end SPV and syndicate platform — vehicle formation, cap table, KYC/AML onboarding, capital calls, lead carry, distributions, general ledger, NAV and member reporting in one system.
 
 ## Solutions (by audience)
 
 - [Solutions overview](https://aama.io/solutions): How Aama.io maps to each type of fund and team.
+- [Fund Administrators & CSPs](https://aama.io/solutions/fund-administrators): Fund accounting for administrators and corporate service providers — segregated books per client fund and VCC sub-fund, consolidated umbrella view, MAS reporting, white-label client reporting, priced per client fund.
 - [VC / PE Firms](https://aama.io/solutions/vc-pe-firms): Multi-fund administration, waterfalls, carry and LP reporting.
 - [Private Credit](https://aama.io/solutions/private-credit): Direct-lending and credit fund accounting — amortised cost, ECL staging (IFRS 9 / SFRS(I) 9), PIK accruals and loan/facility tracking.
 - [SPV Syndicates](https://aama.io/solutions/spv-syndicates): Single- and multi-asset vehicle administration and syndicate reporting.
